                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I just voted NO on the Big Bullshit Bill that House Republicans jammed through today.\n\nThe bill will devastate Nevada by kicking 114,000 off their healthcare, closing hospitals and nursing homes, killing thousands of jobs, and adding TRILLIONS of dollars to our national debt. This is all to pay for billionaire tax breaks. It\u2019s bad news for America and certainly bad news for Nevada.",
