                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "60 years ago today, Medicaid & Medicare were signed into law. Nevadans rely on these programs for everything from cancer treatment to nursing home care and routine checkups.\n\nBut Republicans have made catastrophic cuts to health care with nearly 114,000 Nevadans expected to lose their health coverage. Instead of lowering\u00a0 health care costs low for working families, they are giving tax breaks to their billionaire friends.",
