                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This Administration is ripping away health care from millions of Americans, all so they can give tax breaks to billionaires.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nTheir cuts to Medicaid have jeopardized access to long-term care for approximately 269,000 Nevadans with disabilities. These are some of our most vulnerable folks who need Medicaid to live, work, and fully participate in our community.\n\u00a0\nRead more about how these cuts to services for people with disabilities will impact their day to day lives \u2b07\ufe0f",
