                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Thanks to Medicaid, Shelby is able to live with her family, attend school, and receive medical assistance.\u00a0\n\nBut recent cuts to Medicaid could prevent Shelby and other southern Nevadans from living on their own. Nevada families and communities deserve independence and security\u2014 not cuts to their health care.",
