                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "At just 10 months old, Connor fought meningitis, leaving him permanently disabled. Today, Medicaid provides Connor\u2019s family the resources they need to keep their son safe and healthy.\u00a0\n\nBut recent cuts to Medicaid could mean financial disaster for Connor\u2019s family. I\u2019m fighting to reverse these cuts so millions of Americans can get the health coverage they need to keep their families healthy.",
