                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "When my dad was 56, he lost his job and our health insurance. Then, just months before becoming eligible for Medicare, my mom had a heart attack. Their hospital bill was equivalent to the value of our home.\n\nI\u2019m fighting to make health care affordable. If Republicans in Washington take away the ACA Tax Credits, Nevadans will go without health care and could find themselves in the same situation my parents were in.",
