                "text": "\ud83d\udea8Nearly six in ten ACA marketplace enrollees say they could not afford to pay a health insurance increase of $300/year without it disrupting their finances.\u00a0\n\n\u2705 I\u2019m supporting a bipartisan plan to extend the ACA Tax Credit and stop health care costs from skyrocketing next year.\n\n\ud83e\ude7a Republican leaders need to do the right thing: extend the ACA Tax Credit and save health care for millions of Americans.",
